    "terrainName": "berlin",
    "description": "What: on berlin (flat) a 'Blue Stochastic Squad' (memberless, carrying OPTICS) under a physical 'Blue Platoon' commander watches a PHYSICAL 'Red Squad' (four men) standing 700 m north - outside the 600 m band in which the resolution manager would split the observer. Judge: (1) the stochastic observer detects the physical squad (its level book holds a reported contact, and its own contact pool holds it); (2) it reports SPOT up the chain - the platoon commander hears it; (3) the physical squad never contacts the stochastic unit (it has no body to see); (4) the observer stays stochastic. Fail: no contact, no SPOT, the Red squad's contact pool ever holds the Blue unit, or the observer splits. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh agg-sees-physical"
  },
